cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use IPO Engine in research or in a published analysis, please cite it as below."
title: "IPO Engine"
type: software
abstract: >-
  IPO due diligence for Indian offer documents (DRHP, RHP, prospectus). A page-cited, offline reader
  that shows a figure only when it was re-read from its cited page, plus an eligibility screening
  web app for SEBI ICDR rules. No language model and no network use outside the optional downloader.
authors:
